  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "OpenMaui 10.0.110.8:\n- Linux handlers implement MAUI's handler interfaces\n- ILayoutHandler operations\n- IImageHandler.SourceLoader and IButtonHandler.ImageSourceLoader load images\n- MAUI-signature static Map methods\n- Public platform extensions for the Skia views\n- Names that do not clash with MAUI's\n- Pointer events say which device sent them\n- Touchscreens on Wayland\n- Touchscreens on X11\n- Application.ActivateWindow brings a window to the front\n- Startup notification\n- Shell.SearchHandler\n- HybridWebView `WebResourceRequested` for http and https requests\n- Contacts on KDE\n- The Shell's bottom tab bar is replaced by the top navigation pane\n- OpenMaui's types whose names clash with MAUI's\n- Concrete-handler `Map*` overloads\n- Handlers an app or library registers are used\n- `UseLinux()` no longer replaces a handler the app registered before it\n- Shell tabs are a Windows-style top navigation pane\n- The Shell flyout lists MAUI's flyout items\n- A Shell whose root is a TabBar has no flyout\n- Flyout header Scroll and CollapseOnScroll behaviours\n- A touch reorder drag waited for nothing\n- CarouselView ignored `IsBounceEnabled` and its snap points\n- CarouselView used the left `PeekAreaInsets` on both sides\n- A looping carousel of two items with a peek showed one neighbour\n- ListView went back to the top on every change of its items\n- Window.TitleBar extends into the title bar on X11 and on KDE/Sway Wayland too\n- Client-side decorations: double-click and window menu\n- SecureStorage talks to the Secret Service over D-Bus\n- Application.Quit() closes the app\n- `SkiaFlexLayout` aligned a child with `AlignSelf` Start as Center, Center as End and End as Stretch\n- The Linux `MenuBarHandler` never filled its `SkiaMenuBar`\n- A click on a dimmed popup's backdrop was not a background click\n- Tab moved focus to the page beneath an open popup\n- MediaElement `UriMediaSource.HttpHeaders` reach HLS and DASH segment requests\n- vCard parsing\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/open-maui/maui-linux/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
